    "_postman_id": "b1e7c3a4-2f10-4d8e-9a21-regulatory0001",
    "description": "End-to-end collection for the BPMN-based Regulatory Approval System (Spring Boot 3 + Camunda 7).\n\nRun the requests top-to-bottom (or via the Collection Runner). Test scripts automatically capture the JWT tokens, process instance id, request id and task id into collection variables, so the whole approval flow can be executed without manual copy/paste.\n\nDefault flow (happy path):\n1. Authentication > Generate Token (Reviewer / Manager / Admin / Auditor)\n2. Workflow > Start Workflow  (risk scoring runs, Initial Review task is created)\n3. Tasks > Get My Tasks (Reviewer) -> Complete Task (APPROVED)\n4. Tasks > Get My Tasks (Manager) -> Complete Task (APPROVED)  (compliance check runs)\n5. Tasks > Get My Tasks (Admin) -> Complete Task (APPROVED)  (final approval)\n6. Workflow > Get Workflow Status -> APPROVED\n7. Audit > Get Audit Trail for Process\n\nAll example responses were captured from a live run of the service.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
